<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Bangkok Trip - The Final Reckoning</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: #111827;
            color: #F9FAFB;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 2rem auto;
            padding: 2.5rem;
            background-color: #1F2937;
            border: 1px solid #374151;
            border-radius: 12px;
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #374151;
            padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }
        .title {
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 2.25rem;
        }
        .subtitle {
            color: #9CA3AF;
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
        }
        .section {
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        .section-title {
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: #FBBF24;
        }
        .item {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 1rem 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #374151;
            gap: 1rem;
        }
        .item:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }
        .item-label {
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .item-label span {
            display: block;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: #9CA3AF;
        }
        .item-amount {
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 1rem;
            text-align: right;
        }
        .total-section {
            background-color: #111827;
            border: 1px solid #4B5563;
            padding: 2rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-top: 2rem;
        }
        .final-amount {
            font-size: 3rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            margin: 0.5rem 0;
        }
        .owed-to-teem {
            color: #34D399; /* Green */
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1 class="title">Bangkok Trip - Final Reckoning</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">Hey brother! Here's the final, simple breakdown. No more math!</p>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h2 class="section-title">Breakdown by Event</h2>
            <div class="item grid font-bold text-gray-400 text-sm">
                <span>Event</span>
                <span class="text-right">Total Bill (THB)</span>
                <span class="text-right">Paid By</span>
            </div>
            <div class="item">
                <div class="item-label">Raze + What's Happened</div>
                <div class="item-amount">26,184</div>
                <div class="item-amount text-red-400">Yang</div>
            </div>
            <div class="item">
                <div class="item-label">Salone Di Riva</div>
                <div class="item-amount">52,376</div>
                <div class="item-amount text-red-400/text-green-400">Yang (47,376)<br>Teem (5,000)</div>
            </div>
            <div class="item">
                <div class="item-label">Dinner (Oct 29)</div>
                <div class="item-amount">29,039</div>
                <div class="item-amount text-red-400">Yang</div>
            </div>
            <div class="item">
                <div class="item-label">GOT Club</div>
                <div class="item-amount">57,473</div>
                <div class="item-amount text-green-400">Teem</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
            <!-- Your Group's Share -->
            <div class="section">
                <h2 class="section-title">My Group's Share (What we owe)</h2>
                <div class="space-y-2">
                    <div class="item">
                        <div class="item-label">Raze + WH <span>(50%)</span></div>
                        <div class="item-amount">13,092</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="item">
                        <div class="item-label">Salone Di Riva <span>(25%)</span></div>
                        <div class="item-amount">13,094</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="item">
                        <div class="item-label">GOT Club <span>(3 of 20)</span></div>
                        <div class="item-amount">8,621</div>
                    </div>
                     <div class="item">
                        <div class="item-label">Dinner (Oct 29) <span>(3 of 16)</span></div>
                        <div class="item-amount">5,445</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="item font-bold text-lg bg-gray-800 rounded-md">
                        <div class="item-label">Our Total Share:</div>
                        <div class="item-amount">40,252 THB</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Payment Summary -->
            <div class="section">
                <h2 class="section-title">Final Calculation</h2>
                 <div class="space-y-2">
                    <div class="item">
                        <div class="item-label">Total I Actually Paid <span>(GOT + Deposit)</span></div>
                        <div class="item-amount text-green-400">62,473</div>
                    </div>
                     <div class="item">
                        <div class="item-label">My Group's Fair Share</div>
                        <div class="item-amount">- 40,252</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="item font-bold text-lg bg-gray-800 rounded-md">
                        <div class="item-label">Amount I Overpaid:</div>
                        <div class="item-amount text-green-400">22,221 THB</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- FINAL CALCULATION -->
        <div class="total-section">
            <p class="text-lg">Based on the numbers, your group owes my group 22,221 THB to make it even.</p>
            <p class="text-gray-400 mt-4">But let's just keep it simple as we discussed.</p>
            <p class="text-lg mt-2">Just send me a round:</p>
            <div class="final-amount owed-to-teem">20,000 THB</div>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-2">Money is a small thing between brothers. The memories are what matter!</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>

